title: [+ z_party_name +] Rally
new-page: true

@rally
title: Rally
view-if: z_rally_timer <= 0 and not (labor_minister_party == z_party_name and labor_affairs_timer == 0 and strike_term_seen == 0) and not (sa_force > 25 and not sa_banned and not return_to_normalcy)

The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] will hold a rally

- @class_collaboration
- @rally_catholic
- @rally_nationalism
- @rally_democracy
- @rally_lautenbach
- @rally_local

@sa_disrupt
title: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazi</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> has disrupted the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] rally!
view-if: z_rally_timer <= 0 and not (labor_minister_party == z_party_name and labor_affairs_timer == 0 and strike_term_seen == 0) and sa_force > 25 and not sa_banned and not return_to_normalcy

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazi</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> has disrupted the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] rally!

- @rally_police
- @rally_cancel

@rally_police
title: The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] has called the police to protect their rally
view-if: z_leader == "Kaiser" or z_leader == "Joos" or z_leader == "Wirth"
on-arrival: police_protect_success_z = prussian_police_loyalty * prussian_police_militancy * prussian_police_strength*2 - sa_militancy*sa_strength;

The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] have called the police to protect their rally

go-to: rally_police_win if police_protect_success_z >= 0; rally_police_lose if police_protect_success_z < 0

@rally_cancel
view-if:  z_leader != "Kaiser" and z_leader != "Joos" and z_leader != "Wirth"
title: The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] have canceled their rally

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> have won this show of strength.

@rally_police_win
title: The police have prevailed!

The police successfully protected the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]'s rally, so it can go ahead as usual.

- @class_collaboration
- @rally_catholic
- @rally_nationalism
- @rally_democracy
- @rally_lautenbach
- @rally_local

@rally_police_lose
title: The police were unable or unwilling to hold back the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> mob.

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> have won this show of strength.

@class_collaboration
title: The class collaboration of the proletariat with the bourgeoisie.
view-if: z_leader == "Bracht"

The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]'s mesage of class collaboration appeals to all but the class conscious. [? if workers_schleicher_bonus > 0 : Schleicher's united labor front  ?] [? if workers_schleicher_bonus > 1 : and popularity  ?] [? if workers_schleicher_bonus > 0 : has opposition to corporatism tantamount to support for revolution in the eyes of many. ?]

@rally_catholic
title: Kulturpolitik - the defense of catholic rights and culture.
view-if: z_leader == "Kaas" or z_leader == "Marx"

@rally_nationalism
title: Supporting rearmament, nationalism, and an end to reparations
view-if: z_leader == "Brüning" or z_leader == "Adenauer"

The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]'s speakers praise the military establishment and call for rearmament.

[? if z_autocratization >= 3 : With nationalism increasingly popular within their party, the rally's speakers call for the cessation of reparations and reuinifaction of Germany ?]

@rally_democracy
title: Expanding our nascent democracy and defending it against <span style="color: #808080;">dictatorship</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">fascism</span>.
view-if: z_leader == "Joos" or (z_leader == "Wirth" and (return_to_normalcy or not z_lautenbach_adopted or not (lautenbach_adopted <= z_lautenbach_rally or not z_in_government)))

The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] will defend the <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> system and rail against the <span style="color: #808080;">monarchists</span> and <span style="color: #A00500;">communists</span> who threaten it.

[? if z_democratization < 3 : Talk of democracy does not excite the workers and catholics as much as more practical issues. ?]
[? if z_democratization >= 3 : Since they have consistently made democratization a theme of their campaigns, the workers and catholics are enthusiastic about their message. ?]

@rally_lautenbach
title: Support the Lautenbach plan!
view-if: (z_leader == "Wirth" or z_leader == "Stegerwald") and z_lautenbach_adopted and not return_to_normalcy and (lautenbach_adopted <= z_lautenbach_rally or not z_in_government)

The Lautenbach plan has become a popular rallying cry for the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]. The workers and employers see it as a necessary compromise. [? if not lautenbach_adopted: However, many are still skeptical whether the plan will actually prove effective. ?]

@rally_local
title: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
view-if: z_leader == "Stegerwald" and not (return_to_normalcy or not z_lautenbach_adopted or not (lautenbach_adopted <= z_lautenbach_rally or not z_in_government))

The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]'s speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect the workers in this moment.
